},"effects":[{"set":"a3_open"},{"post":{"from":"npc_kn_maud","text":"Love — The hatch has shut. Fourth time in my life. There's wardens camped by the stand and they're polite about it, which I don't like. Corin's up on the slope with the rifle and won't come down for his tea, and the well's on a cup a head. This came out of the tray before it shut, with your name on it near enough, so I'm sending it on. Come home. — Maud"}},{"post":{"from":"npc_c9_05","text":"HATCH CLOSED. THANK YOU FOR YOUR CONTINUITY. PLEASE COME HOME."}},{"give":"k_a3_mother_letter"},{"post":{"from":"npc_ar_voice","text":"BY COURIER — TO THE DESIGNATE — ONE ITEM, SEALED. RECEIVED AND SIGNED FOR."}},{"give":"k_a3_order"},{"quest":"q_a3_order","start":true},{"decision":{"id":"a3_open","text":"The morning after Openfield's Long Night the post found me: word from Knock that the hatch had shut, and a sealed order from the city."}}]},"a3_recall_notice":{"id":"a3_recall_notice","at":{"hour":7},"armedIf":{"all":[{"flag":"a3_order_read"},{"all":[{"flag":"nine_joined"},{"not":{"flag":"nine_left"}},{"not":{"any":[{"flag":"nine_gone"},{"flag":"nine_disposed"},{"flag":"a3_nine_struck"}]}}]},{"quest":"q_a3_recall","status":"none"},{"not":{"flag":"a3_recall"}}]},"effects":[{"post":{"from":"npc_ar_voice","text":"PRECINCT OF MERIDIAN — UNIT 9 (ASSESSOR, CIVIL) — DISPOSAL — AS SCHEDULED — R31 BROUGHT FORWARD. THE KEEPER WILL PRESENT THE UNIT AT THE PRECINCT GATE."}},{"set":"a3_recall_due"},{"quest":"q_a3_recall","start":true}]},"a3_verity_band":{"id":"a3_verity_band","at":{"hour":7},"armedIf":{"all":[{"quest":"q_a3_mast","status":"active"},{"flag":"bw_static","eq":"kept"},{"not":{"dead":"npc_bw_04"}}]},"effects":[{"post":{"from":"npc_bw_04","text":"Heard you on the wire, which is not a thing I say lightly. The girl says Signal Hill, and your name beside it, and that you want it loud. Then put it where we listen: the hiss band, midnight to two, the one the wire wakes on. Every radio in the Reach hears that band, even the ones with no backs on, because it is where the city's own wire leaks, and nobody ever built a radio that can't. The figures are under this, in her hand. Swear it on the hiss you won't use it to sell anything. — V."}},{"learn":"a3_verity_band"}]},"a3_burning":{"id":"a3_burning","at":{"hour":2,"where":"c9_mouth"},"armedIf":{"all":[{"flag":"a3_unwritten","eq":"burning"},{"at":"c9_mouth"}]},"effects":[{"set":"a3_mother","value":"burned"},{"set":"a3_archive","value":"burned"},{"news":{"tag":"a3_burning","text":"the Cistern's caretaker burned in the night, by the Choir's grey people, with the designate on the slope","valence":-15,"size":8,"at":"cistern9"}},{"decision":{"id":"a3_burning","text":"The Unwritten went down the grate at Knock and burned MOTHER's panel and the Cistern's Archive, with me on the slope."}},{"event":"dialogue","data":{"tree":"d_a3_burning","name":"Knock"}}]},"a3_summons":{"id":"a3_summons","at":{"hour":7},"armedIf":{"all":[{"flag":"a3_open"},{"flag":"a3_c9"}]},"effects":[{"set":"a3_summoned"},{"post":{"from":"npc_ar_voice","text":"THE DESIGNATE WILL ATTEND THE STEPS."}},{"give":"k_a3_summons"},{"quest":"q_a3_spire","start":true},{"quest":"q_a3_hold","start":true},{"decision":{"id":"a3_summoned","text":"With the Cistern's door settled, the Ledger sent its card: the designate will attend the steps."}}]},"a3_buffer_post":{"id":"a3_buffer_post","at":{"hour":7},"armedIf":{"all":[{"all":[{"all":[{"flag":"a3_c9","eq":"relocated"},{"any":[{"flag":"a3_c9_how","eq":"order"},{"flag":"a3_c9_how","eq":"forced"},{"flag":"a3_c9_how","eq":"consent"}]}]},{"not":{"flag":"a3_c9_after"}}]},{"quest":"q_a3_platform","status":"none"}]},"effects":[{"post":{"from":"npc_ar_voice","text":"PRECINCT SUPPLY — RESERVE 9 (THE MOUTH) — IN TRANSIT BY THE RIVER ROAD TO CARRICK — TO BE RECEIVED AT THE BUFFER ON THE DESIGNATE'S ATTENDANCE. Under the type, in pencil, in a hand from the column's table: Fed and watered, and sleeping under the canvas. The car will stand at the buffer until you come and say a word to it. Nobody is in a hurry but me."}},{"quest":"q_a3_platform","start":true}]},"a3_offer_column":{"id":"a3_offer_column","at":{"hour":9},"armedIf":{"all":[{"all":[{"flag":"a3_order_read"},{"not":{"flag":"a3_route_home"}},{"not":{"flag":"a3_at_knock"}}]},{"all":[{"any":[{"flag":"ln_alliance","eq":"ledger"},{"member":"wardens"},{"all":[{"any":[{"flag":"ln_alliance","eq":"truce"},{"all":[{"flag":"ln_done"},{"not":{"flag":"ln_alliance"}}]}]},{"flag":"ln_owed"}]}]},{"not":{"all":[{"any":[{"dead":"npc_md_01"},{"dead":"npc_md_01_apron"}]},{"dead":"npc_md_12"}]}}]},{"not":{"any":[{"dead":"npc_md_01"},{"dead":"npc_md_01_apron"}]}}]},"effects":[{"post":{"from":"npc_md_01","text":"Designate — The car for Reserve 9 leaves the Precinct gate at seven any morning the designate is aboard it. My orders are to carry the attendance with the car. I would rather you came with me than came to me. I am at my desk under the clause, as always. — I. Lowe, Captain, Precinct wardens"}},{"learn":"a3_ride_column"}]},"a3_offer_column_reyes":{"id":"a3_offer_column_reyes","at":{"hour":9},"armedIf":{"all":[{"all":[{"flag":"a3_order_read"},{"not":{"flag":"a3_route_home"}},{"not":{"flag":"a3_at_knock"}}]},{"all":[{"any":[{"flag":"ln_alliance","eq":"ledger"},{"member":"wardens"},{"all":[{"any":[{"flag":"ln_alliance","eq":"truce"},{"all":[{"flag":"ln_done"},{"not":{"flag":"ln_alliance"}}]}]},{"flag":"ln_owed"}]}]},{"not":{"all":[{"any":[{"dead":"npc_md_01"},{"dead":"npc_md_01_apron"}]},{"dead":"npc_md_12"}]}}]},{"any":[{"dead":"npc_md_01"},{"dead":"npc_md_01_apron"}]}]},"effects":[{"post":{"from":"npc_md_12","text":"Designate — Captain Lowe's car for Reserve 9 is mine to command now. It leaves the Precinct gate at seven any morning the designate is aboard. He would have wanted to carry you rather than meet you at the door. So would I. Find me at the gate. — P. Reyes, Sergeant"}},{"learn":"a3_ride_column"}]},"a3_offer_first":{"id":"a3_offer_first","at":{"hour":9},"armedIf":{"all":[{"all":[{"flag":"a3_order_read"},{"not":{"flag":"a3_route_home"}},{"not":{"flag":"a3_at_knock"}}]},{"all":[{"any":[{"flag":"ln_alliance","eq":"guild"},{"member":"tollmen","rank":"hand"},{"all":[{"any":[{"flag":"ln_alliance","eq":"truce"},{"all":[{"flag":"ln_done"},{"not":{"flag":"ln_alliance"}}]}]},{"flag":"ln_owed"}]}]},{"not":{"dead":"npc_kn_factor"}}]}]},"effects":[{"post":{"from":"npc_kn_factor","text":"Designate — The guild's compliments, and a seat: first class, in the guild's own car behind the engine of the Concern's through, out of Carrick at four any morning, as far as Four Ways; the guild's coach from there down our own road. Show this to the boy at the Line's window in the shed. I am going home to my stand myself. — I. Orme, Factor, Knock"}},{"learn":"a3_ride_first"}]},"a3_offer_carts":{"id":"a3_offer_carts","at":{"hour":9},"armedIf":{"all":[{"all":[{"flag":"a3_order_read"},{"not":{"flag":"a3_route_home"}},{"not":{"flag":"a3_at_knock"}}]},{"all":[{"any":[{"flag":"ln_alliance","eq":"choir"},{"member":"choir"},{"all":[{"any":[{"flag":"ln_alliance","eq":"truce"},{"all":[{"flag":"ln_done"},{"not":{"flag":"ln_alliance"}}]}]},{"flag":"ln_owed"}]}]},{"not":{"flag":"ln_people","eq":"removed"}},{"not":{"flag":"ln_people","eq":"relocated"}}]}]},"effects":[{"post":{"from":"npc_of_06","text":"Knock is dry since its hatch shut; we heard it on the road. The Choir is taking it water, by the old south bed, where the guild has no gates. The carts leave the yard at first light any morning you come to walk with them. Nobody is writing this down. — Doria, keeper, Openfield"}},{"learn":"a3_ride_carts"}]},"a3_home":{"id":"a3_home","at":{"hour":0,"where":"c9_mouth"},"armedIf":{"all":[{"flag":"a3_order_read"},{"not":{"flag":"a3_at_knock"}}]},"effects":[{"set":"a3_at_knock"},{"set":"a3_in_sallow"},{"learn":"loc_cistern9"}]},"a3_home_road":{"id":"a3_home_road","at":{"hour":0,"where":"c9_mouth"},"armedIf":{"all":[{"flag":"a3_order_read"},{"not":{"flag":"a3_route_home"}}]},"effects":[{"set":"a3_route_home","value":"foot"},{"xp":100},{"decision":{"id":"a3_route_home","text":"I came home to Knock under my own steam, by the roads I knew, and nobody carried me."}}]}}